O.J.: Made in America is a documentary, crime,
history film directed by Ezra Edelman.

2
00:40:36,521 --> 00:40:42,521
A chronicle of the rise and fall of O.J.

3
01:00:54,782 --> 01:01:00,782
Simpson, whose high-profile murder trial exposed the extent of American
racial tensions, revealing a fractured and divided nation.

4
